{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_847.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"9aa975ba4381945cd628193dc61baa565f1353e7987a4f0027a564f06cc89866","ja":"さてと、ついにライブ最終日や！\n最後の差し入れは、ふたりで持ち寄りやったやんな。","zh":"那么，终于到了演出的最后一天！\n最后的慰问品，是我们俩一起凑的吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_847.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"53199deb37e111b9b4a8a1cf3733293e888549dd7bfbcac3f2a5e75e4524b7aa","ja":"それじゃあ私から。奈緒ちゃん知ってた？　今日は\n『Jus-2-Mint』結成からちょうど1ヶ月なの！","zh":"那么，就由我开始吧。奈绪知道吗？　今天是\n『Jus-2-Mint』结成正好1个月了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_847.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"56a3aff09050952b8d7c67e3a0f408ce412541e1958b34056c2a94de16809d7c","ja":"それを記念して……じゃーん！　\nジャスミンのシフォンケーキ作ってきたんだ！","zh":"为了纪念这个……当当！\n我做了茉莉戚风蛋糕！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_847.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"5f51894173f5ebecbd5940f96bd603db9b2d7f9280ca70affe3fbe3482d2a00f","ja":"ええーっ！？","zh":"咦咦──！？","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_847.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"f633f619d4500e2f6348fd913809fb4b5440d2eb15bf2991369aaa17c022be2d","ja":"えへへ、そんなに驚いてくれて嬉しいな♪\n結成1ヶ月記念のチョコプレートも飾ったよ！","zh":"嘿嘿，你这么惊讶，我好开心♪\n我还装饰了纪念结成1个月的巧克力牌哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_847.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"7d9daf70fda3034280e9fe294a71b7f95132cd0b9a11e2e35a426aa5eb5531ba","ja":"いや、実はな……私の差し入れも、ケーキやねん。\n1ヶ月記念のプレート付き……。","zh":"不，其实呢……我带来的慰问品也是蛋糕。\n附有1个月纪念的牌子……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_847.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"a618bc1adfee8e5b900473ec1e7af6f5b0e0f4c681a8dbbfdc300593366f98d0","ja":"えっ？　しかもこれ、ジャスミンのシフォンケーキ！？\nすごい偶然！　でも、奈緒ちゃんも覚えてたんだね♪","zh":"咦？而且这还是茉莉戚风蛋糕！？\n好巧！不过奈绪也还记得呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_847.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"e2c08651e8829f09d4d5a1e858fe2df501d8efe9b8fc5b8b1aeabde15458a0d2","ja":"そら、美奈子との大切な記念日やし……って、\n何言わすねん！　顔熱なってきたわ……。","zh":"毕竟是和美奈子一起度过的重要纪念日嘛……  \n你干吗让我说这种话！脸都开始发烫了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_847.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"6f8e5cf4518fd14db9ed0a24a8eee7054e19308db6e3080f3d3105be5619e62e","ja":"ふふっ、ミラクルな記念日になったね♪　それじゃあ、\nさっそく写真撮ろっ？　ふたつのケーキを並べて……。","zh":"呵呵，变成了奇迹般的纪念日呢♪ 那么，\n赶紧来拍照吧？把两个蛋糕并排摆好……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_847.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"01213d1456b5324e654707a7e8e19d090677914c48d8d44b1295bb61c42aeadd","ja":"い、いや、それはアカンて！\n美奈子のだけでええから……！","zh":"不、不行，那可不行啊！\n只要美奈子的就够了……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_847.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"888bf8b1b70cf534d9064bce0b7c497c6c436543ea608900d05db53482ace179","ja":"でも、奈緒ちゃんも記念日のために、\nこのケーキを作ってきてくれたんでしょ？","zh":"但是，奈绪也是为了纪念日，\n才做了这个蛋糕带来的吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_847.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"3f467fd668eae6eb4b21062eb973416cb1b42ec6b234dc7d6c8b7cceff8a6fef","ja":"せやけど……ふたりでおんなじもん作ってきた\nなんて、なんや恥ずかしくて……。","zh":"不过……两个人一起做了同样的东西\n什么的，真是让人不好意思……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_847.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"aade1f3668fa3ddc8fb97330d90806db50df901831d1818d302207af2f743dc8","ja":"しかも、1ヶ月記念のプレートまでおそろいって、\nこんなんもう、カップルやん！","zh":"而且，连1个月纪念的盘子都是成对的，这已经就是情侣了嘛！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_847.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"6ed1dce1e62400e81344371358346a034dac04cbf2e79a633c2c10a5dcce2b34","ja":"私は平気だよ？　それに、私たちの『映え』、ファンの\nみんなも期待してるし、撮るしかないって思うな♪","zh":"我没问题哦？而且，我们的“上镜”，粉丝们也都期待着，我觉得只能拍了♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_847.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"4bf407e0b778dd07382ed3a94e8d168690549a18ab24cc77a08a587789103d65","ja":"うう……美奈子のハガネのようなメンタル、\nうらやましいわ……私より、SNS向いてるんちゃう？","zh":"呜呜……美奈子钢铁般的心理素质，\n真让人羡慕啊……比起我，她不是更适合社交媒体吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_847.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"1fcbf4d83092478d6de1fa06b01ebd315627a811a23df98c122c20ad909af08b","ja":"えへへ、でも、私たちの仲が、一番の『映え』だよね！\nほら、みんなに見せつけちゃお♪","zh":"嘿嘿，不过，我们的友情才是最『上镜』的！\n来，向所有人炫耀一下吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:18:05+00:00"}
